2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Heikki was a Ratsutilallinen (owner of a large farm that was given a tax break, because the he took care of a cavalryman to ensure that fighting men were ready in case of war).  This farm was on the Keisari Farm in the village of 
2 CONC Torttila in the Harjavalta Parish.
