2 CONT Anna Lisa Pehrsdotter.  Born in Pori in the village of Indarö on November 15, 1797. She came to Nakkila 11 December 1818 from Ulvila.  It is said that "Before the marriage with Henrik Andersson she was his housekeeper for a long t
