2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Maria Elisa Johansdotter Tupi. Born 18 Dec 1826 in Kiukainen. Parents: Johan Tupi and Kaisa Kalli. She was born out of wedlock as Kaisantytär in Kiukainen. Moved with her mother 4 July 1836 from Kiukainen to Harjavalta. When the m
2 CONC other married Johan Tupi from Harjavalta 16 June 1836, her name changed immediately to Maria Elisa Johansdotter Tupi. In the Harjavalta confirmation records of 1891-1900 was recorded as being blind. She died 15 Sepember 1905 in Ha
2 CONC rjavalta.
