2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Frans Henrik Hammas. He was born in 1846 in Harjavalta. Population records from 1880-1882 from the Hammas farm in Harjavalta tell that back then the only one of Henrik's sons living there was Frans, his wife Amanda (born 1850) and
2 CONC  their two underage sons. The family moved to Rajaoja in Kokemäki some time around 1870-1878 or later.  He changed his name to Murto, supposedly after the sharecropper's farm, where they moved.
