1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Johan Nestor Hammas. He was born Mar 10, 1870 in Harjavalta.  He moved with his family from Harjavalta to Kiikka station to be the station master 8 Jun 1899. Mirja Laaninen writes 1980: 'The parish archives say that Johan Nestor a
2 CONC nd his family moved to Rauma in 1929. It is obvious that they actually moved earlier, maybe 1918-1919-1920. Juho Nestor took part in the civil war and was imprisoned in the POW camp in Hennala, Lahti (or somewhere else). The rest 
2 CONC of the family lived at that time in the Murto house in Kokemäki with the brother of Johan Nestor. After that the family moved to Rauma, to Unaja, Fredrika Fransina's home. Later Johan got a job working for Rauma-Repola and the fam
2 CONC ily could move to 'Talola', which was owned by the company. He died on October 31, 1951 in Rauma.
2 CONT
