1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 💞 Wilho Henrik Giers is [https://www.geni.com/path/Eric-af-Kumo+is+related+to+Wilho-Henrik-Giers?from=6000000019395507263&path_type=blood&to=6000000008773209050 '''Eric Larsson af Kumo's'''] 13th great grandson.
2 CONT 💞 Ella Giers (Stenij) is [https://www.geni.com/path/Eric-af-Kumo+is+related+to+Ella-Giers-Stenij?from=6000000019395507263&path_type=blood&to=6000000008773465433 '''Eric Larsson af Kumo's'''] 13th great granddaughter.
