2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT As a child Rantsa Vihtori contracted small pox.  In 1846, he moved from his home at Mikkola Farm and went to Pietala farm in Harjakangas village where he worked as a farmland.  Later, the same year he moved back Home.  On November
2 CONC  5, 1847 Rantsa moved to Eura Parish.  Late the following autumn, on November 22, 1848, he moved back home.  By that time he was a master cobbler. Rantsa, upon being admitted to the Guild had taken the Swedish surname of Lindvall.
2 CONC
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
